Curators Comments:
The beads were found at Level 28, dated by Petrie to 'between Ka and Menes'. The true date is probably rather later than this, to judge from the glazed baboon figures found at the same level. Cf. 1929,1015.532: long cylindrical beads from Mostagedda with s lightly deeper coloured glaze, dated by the excavator to the Fifth Dynasty.
